gnostic; encoder E errors are consequences of absent members. Public repr defects are independently isolated by equal full map values and stable public module names, within one formatter owner. Encoders are priority 5 with one semantic owner and available carriers; registration glue affects tie-break, not priority.','tie_break':'Unique priority-4 cohort under the mandatory grouping of the step; no tie-break required. Two formatting projections, not one universal causal algorithm.','auxiliary_scope':['Named module repr controls corroborate formatter but do not inflate 12 scored paths.','Anonymous plugin identity and its message conflict with explicit plugin/Module contract; no existing canonical anonymous carrier is demonstrated. Priority-2 eligibility is absent.','External diagnostic path difference follows explicit L0 prefix-stripping/fallback contract; no demonstrated existing canonical alternative, so lower-priority contract debt.','Query successful warning differs, but successful bilateral classification compares values. Warning contract is outside frozen module observable; no warning parity claimed.','Panic was an adapter for divergent repr. Complete stderr differs, including anchor; no separately frozen paired equal-message panic control establishes an independent diagnostic cohort. Recorded as auxiliary limitation, not erased.']}\naudit.update({'phase':'FINAL','executed_at':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'checks':checks,'issues':issues,'manifest_sha256':manifest_hash,'manifest_pin_occurrences':len(pins),'manifest_unique_pinned_paths':len(pinned_paths),'ownership':owner_check,'ledger_counts':dict(ledger_classes),'ledger_unique_paths':len(newby),'ledger_residual_paths':160,'temporal_changes':changes,'temporal_regressions':regressions,'finalist_paths_recomputed':finalists,'selection':decision,'allowlist_status_short':status,'staging_empty':True,'DAG_policy':'immutable inputs -> manifest -> log/receipt/certificate -> report; no report ha